flowchart TD
  A[Buyer opens live auction] --> B{Authenticated + KYC/bank approved?}
  B -->|No| C[Block with verification required]
  B -->|Yes| D[Enter bid amount]
  D --> E[POST /api/auctions/:id/bids]
  E --> F[Lock auction row FOR UPDATE]
  F --> G{status=live and endsAt > now?}
  G -->|No| H[Reject bid]
  G -->|Yes| I{amount >= minimumNextBid?}
  I -->|No| H
  I -->|Yes| J[Insert Bid + update currentBid/bidCount]
  J --> K[Emit Socket.IO bid:new]
  K --> L[Notify previous top bidder if outbid]
  L --> M[Return 201 + updated auction]
